{"type":"Film","id":"FR2014_164","slug":"fr2014-164-repas-de-famille","title":{"native":"Repas de famille","english":""},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2014-12-03","year":2014},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"Pierre-Henry Salfati","slug":"pierre-henry-salfati","name":"Pierre-Henry Salfati","birthYear":1953,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]}],"genre":["Comedy"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/55/16/135223/format_page/repas-de-famille.jpg","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HDZWhpU9qDE"},"synopsis":{"native":"Mr Poggi rêve de la mairie de son village. Il est carrossier et de droite. Avec sa femme, la pulpeuse Bernadette, ils invitent leur beau-frère et belle-sœur , Bruno et Huguette , profs de gauche, pour un déjeuner dominical. Le thème des retrouvailles est explosif : « qui va prendre Mamie à noël ? » Le repas de famille peut commencer… Tous les ingrédients sont là… La politique, les histoires d’héritages, l’éducation des enfants, la religion et même la drogue. Les cigales chantent, les parents gueulent, les enfants trinquent… C’est la journée la plus délirante de l’année et ça serait dommage de la rater. Au fait ? Mais qui va prendre Mamie à noël ?","english":"Mr. Poggi dreams of becoming the mayor of his village. He is a car-body maker and right wing. With his wife, buxom Bernadette, he invites his brother- and sister-in-law, Bruno and Huguette, left-wing teachers, for Sunday lunch. The theme of this family get together is explosive: \"Who's looking after Granny at Christmas?\" The family meal can be begin... All the ingredients are ready to go into the mix: politics, inheritance issues, raising children, religion, and even drugs. The cicadas sing, the parents shout, the children take the rap... It's the craziest day of the year and it would be a shame to miss it. But who's looking after Granny at Christmas?"},"production":[{"country":"France","share":"Majority coproducer"}],"characters":[{"id":"FR2014_164_01","film":"FR2014_164","person":{"id":"Éric Carrière","slug":"eric-carriere","name":"Éric Carrière","birthYear":1957,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"age":"2: Late Middle Age (55-60)","gender":"Male identifying","sexuality":"Heterosexual","origin":"White Western European","class":"Middle class","profession":"Employed","ability":"Able-bodied","assistedMobility":"No"},{"id":"FR2014_164_02","film":"FR2014_164","person":{"id":"Francis Ginibre","slug":"francis-ginibre","name":"Francis Ginibre","birthYear":1959,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"age":"2: Late Middle Age (55-60)","gender":"Male identifying","sexuality":"Heterosexual","origin":"White Western European","class":"Upper Middle class","profession":"Self-employed","ability":"Able-bodied","assistedMobility":"No"},{"id":"FR2014_164_03","film":"FR2014_164","person":{"id":"Noëlle Perna","slug":"noelle-perna","name":"Noëlle Perna","birthYear":1954,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"age":"2: Late Middle Age (55-60)","gender":"Female identifying","sexuality":"Heterosexual","origin":"White Western European","class":"Upper Middle class","profession":"Unemployed","ability":"Able-bodied","assistedMobility":"No"},{"id":"FR2014_164_04","film":"FR2014_164","person":{"id":"Lorella Cravotta","slug":"lorella-cravotta","name":"Lorella Cravotta","birthYear":1958,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"age":"2: Late Middle Age (55-60)","gender":"Female identifying","sexuality":"Heterosexual","origin":"White Western European","class":"Middle class","profession":"Employed","ability":"Able-bodied","assistedMobility":"No"}],"roles":[{"person":{"id":"Francis Ginibre","slug":"francis-ginibre","name":"Francis Ginibre","birthYear":1959,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"r